# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-23 18:31:15 UTC

Base revision: `148b2528` on `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`.
This entry records a server-free P18-V02 refresh and closes the deterministic
2,000-concurrent-send test gap identified in P18-04.

## P18-04 stress coverage addition

Added `producer_handles_two_thousand_concurrent_async_sends_without_losing_requests`
to the scripted producer loopback tests. It starts 2,000 async sends at once,
waits up to 45 seconds for completion, and verifies the scripted Broker saw
exactly 2,000 requests with every body once, a unique message ID per request,
and no retries. Added the case to `tests/stress/run-offline-smoke.sh` and
updated the stress README. The expanded runner contains 18 deterministic cases
and repeats each three times.

