The current full workspace default and all-feature suites, doctests, and strict
Clippy passed after commit `148b2528`. Maven verification passed 37 scenarios,
11 Java message fixtures, and Java decoding of 106 Rust typed headers and 19
Rust typed bodies. Metadata checks covered workspace dependency direction and
package license files. The Windows GNU result is a compile check, not native
Windows runtime evidence.

The release-example build and benchmark were run immediately before the
stress-test-only commit `148b2528`; no product source or benchmark input changed
in that commit. Benchmark values are appended to
`PHASE_18_OFFLINE_BENCHMARK_BASELINE.md`; they are observations, not thresholds.

## Scope still open

The added stress case closes only the thousands-of-concurrent-sends item.
Broad P18-V01 Java source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and Rust
reverse-export reconciliation remains open. Native Windows runtime and
current-revision remote Ubuntu CI were not run. Phase 19 Broker/Docker and
cross-language live scenarios remain separate. No plan was edited, no remote
CI or push was run, and the four pre-existing Phase 19 worktree paths remain
untouched and unstaged.
